# Ajani, Caller of the Pride, -3 with its target gone: the loyalty cost is paid as the ability is activated (CR 606.4, 602.2b), so
# when Bot2 Lightning Bolts the targeted Memnite in response the ability finds its only target illegal and does nothing (CR 608.2b):
# the other Memnite, which was not targeted, gets neither flying nor double strike, and Ajani stays at 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Ajani, Caller of the Pride
Memnite
Memnite
Plains x3
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x10

