Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ajani, Caller of the Pride.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
